Revision history for Perl extension App::Normalo.

0.08  Sun Oct 11 14:27:39 2026
	- Leave a file whose name isn't valid UTF-8 alone and report it, instead
	  of silently dropping its non-ASCII bytes; convert() now dies on such
	  a name (#7)
	- Declare the license (perl_5) and the minimum Perl version (5.40) in
	  the distribution metadata (#12)
	- Keep the version number only in the module's $VERSION: drop the
	  copies in bin/normalo, the POD and README, and have flake.nix read
	  it from the module (#13)
	- Add `make lint` (perlcritic, and perltidy without rewriting files),
	  and run it in CI through `nix flake check` (#13)

0.07  Sun Oct 11 14:04:37 2026
	- Leave a file unchanged if nothing of its stem survives normalization,
	  rather than renaming `!!!.txt` to the hidden `.txt` (#3)

0.06  Sun Oct 11 14:03:47 2026
	- Trim hyphens from the start and end of the name, so that `-Dash.txt`
	  becomes `dash.txt` rather than a name that looks like an option (#4)

0.05  Sun Oct 11 13:56:12 2026
	- Keep going after a path that can't be renamed, report it, and exit 1
	  at the end, instead of stopping at the first failure (#1)
	- Report a failed rename and exit 1 instead of dying with errno as the
	  exit status, and prefix every error message with the program name (#8)
	- Point the POD's BUGS AND LIMITATIONS section at the GitHub issue
	  tracker, and add bugtracker and repository links to the distribution
	  metadata (#16)
	- Move the work of run() into main(), which takes the program name and
	  output filehandles as parameters instead of using $0, STDOUT and
	  STDERR (#15)

0.04  Sat Oct 10 19:04:01 2026
	- Normalize file extensions like the rest of the name: decode them as UTF-8,
	  transliterate to ASCII, and drop anything that is not alphanumeric. This
	  stops non-ASCII extensions from being lowercased into invalid UTF-8 (#6)
	- Drop an extension that normalizes to nothing, and leave a name that
	  normalizes to nothing unchanged, rather than producing names like `foo.`
	  or `.`
	- Add tests for run()

0.03  Sat Oct 18 21:46:22 2025
	- Prevent file clobbering by checking if target exists before renaming

0.02  Sat Oct 18 20:12:47 2025
	- Convert control characters to hyphens instead of removing them

0.01  Sat Oct 18 16:16:33 2025
	- original version; created by h2xs 1.23 with options
		-AX --skip-exporter --use-new-tests -n App::Normalo

